<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> - QQ登录网站</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .banned-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 48px 40px;
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .banned-icon {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4d4f, #cf1322);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .banned-icon svg {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      fill: white;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #cf1322;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .ip-display {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #fff1f0;
      color: #cf1322;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .reason-box {
      background: #fff7f7;
      border: 1px solid #ffccc7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .reason-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .reason-text {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .info-text {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .time-text {
      color: #999;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="banned-card">
    <div class="banned-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h1>访问被禁止</h1>
    <div class="ip-display">IP: <%= ip %></div>
    
    <p class="info-text">
      您的IP地址已被管理员封禁，无法访问本网站。
    </p>

    <% if (reason) { %>
      <div class="reason-box">
        <div class="reason-label">封禁原因</div>
        <div class="reason-text"><%= reason %></div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <% if (banned_at) { %>
      <p class="time-text">
        封禁时间：<%= banned_at.slice(0, 10) + ' ' + banned_at.slice(11, 16) %>
      </p>
    <% } %>

    <p class="info-text" style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px;">
      如有疑问，请联系网站管理员。
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
